│  1   (A) Buy                                                                                     │
│  1   (A) Buy                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 N  sort(manual)  1 prioritized (A)  x done  t start  T wont  o new  a append            1|2  9.9.9
-- a-file --
(A) Buy
(A) Buy
